From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 07:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: keep Aurora TDM CPU and codec polarity separate

Aurora Android 14 requests CLOCK_ATTRIBUTE_INVERT_COUPLE_NO (4) on the
ADSP TDM clock, but the OEM CS35L43 startup uses DSP_A with NB_NF.
Forwarding the CPU inversion flag to the codec changes its sampling edge:
ASP_CONTROL2 bit 6 is set in Linux whereas the stock codec clears it.

Allow an explicit CPU TDM format and retain the existing codec-derived
fallback for other boards. Keep Aurora's ADSP configuration unchanged and
match the stock codec format. Leave TX widths and protection coefficients
unchanged so playback acceptance can isolate this correction.

Source: Xiaomi aurora-u-oss CS35L43 startup and msm_common TDM clock setup:
https://github.com/MiCode/vendor_qcom_opensource_audio-kernel/blob/d2ddef03a379bc82c7bcd08481e29e08bbff80eb/asoc/codecs/cs35l43/cs35l43.c
https://github.com/MiCode/vendor_qcom_opensource_audio-kernel/blob/d2ddef03a379bc82c7bcd08481e29e08bbff80eb/asoc/msm_common.c
Android OS1.0.3.0.UNACNXM live DT has qcom,tdm-clk-attribute = <4 ...>;
codec startup logs fmt=0x4004, 48 kHz, width=32 and sysclk=6144000.

Signed-off-by: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
---
diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c b/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
@@ -67,6 +67,7 @@
 	const struct snd_kcontrol_new *controls;
 	int num_controls;
 	unsigned int codec_dai_fmt;
+	unsigned int tdm_cpu_dai_fmt;
 	snd_pcm_format_t tdm_format;
 	bool codec_sysclk_set;
 	bool mi2s_mclk_enable;
@@ -127,9 +128,9 @@
 	if (!cpu_cfg.slots)
 		return 0;
 
-	ret = snd_soc_dai_set_fmt(cpu_dai,
-		(data->priv->codec_dai_fmt & ~SND_SOC_DAIFMT_CLOCK_PROVIDER_MASK) |
-		SND_SOC_DAIFMT_BP_FP);
+	ret = snd_soc_dai_set_fmt(cpu_dai, data->priv->tdm_cpu_dai_fmt ?:
+		((data->priv->codec_dai_fmt & ~SND_SOC_DAIFMT_CLOCK_PROVIDER_MASK) |
+		 SND_SOC_DAIFMT_BP_FP));
 	if (ret && ret != -ENOTSUPP)
 		return ret;
 
@@ -555,7 +556,9 @@
 	.num_dapm_widgets = ARRAY_SIZE(sc8280xp_dapm_widgets),
 	.wcd_jack = true,
 	.codec_sysclk_set = true,
-	.codec_dai_fmt = SND_SOC_DAIFMT_BC_FC | SND_SOC_DAIFMT_IB_NF | SND_SOC_DAIFMT_DSP_A,
+	/* OEM ADSP clock attribute 4, but CS35L43 startup uses NB_NF. */
+	.tdm_cpu_dai_fmt = SND_SOC_DAIFMT_BP_FP | SND_SOC_DAIFMT_IB_NF | SND_SOC_DAIFMT_DSP_A,
+	.codec_dai_fmt = SND_SOC_DAIFMT_BC_FC | SND_SOC_DAIFMT_NB_NF | SND_SOC_DAIFMT_DSP_A,
 };
 
 static const struct qcom_snd_soc_common sm8650_priv_data = {
